{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"灣仔私家車失事撞壆翻側　司機受傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-WANCHAI-261021-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】灣仔警察總部對開晚上有私家車失事撞壆翻側，司機受傷送院。</p><p>涉事私家車擋風玻璃碎裂、車身損毀，安全氣袋彈出。</p><p>現場是夏愨道往中環方向近軍器廠街對開，警方晚上10時許接報，私家車失事撞壆翻側，懷疑司機被困，救護人員接報到場，司機受傷清醒，經包紮後送院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:35.251950+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:51:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.646706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:10.855542+00:00","content_hash":"6c31892ae24f79b6f8a1f7fddf055140151e5162c5badae23cbf08ff82098138","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:35.251950+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}